<title>UK: Energy Group H1 underlying profits rise.</title>
<headline>Energy Group H1 underlying profits rise.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Energy Group Plc, set to merge with U.S. group PacifiCorp, said on Friday its first half underlying operating profit rose 30 percent to 317 million stg on a pro forma basis.</p>
</text>
